# Git: Commit and Push to GitHub

After completing meaningful changes in this project, commit and push to:

https://github.com/BethelHills/orbit-os.git

## Workflow

1. Run `git status`, `git diff`, and `git log -3` in `/Users/hb/orbit-os`
2. Stage only project files under `orbit-os` (never parent home-directory repos)
3. Write a concise commit message focused on **why**
4. Commit and push: `git push origin main`
5. Never force-push to `main`

## Scope

- Repository root: `/Users/hb/orbit-os`
- Remote: `origin` → `https://github.com/BethelHills/orbit-os.git`
- Do not commit `.env*` files, `node_modules`, or `.next`
